{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2990","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2990","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2990\",\"parent_revision\":\"28c6cf1b0cec612518e0e9238921720f5b54ae1f29c6b37f756651472c3f8ad3\",\"root_revision\":\"28c6cf1b0cec612518e0e9238921720f5b54ae1f29c6b37f756651472c3f8ad3\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P0\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-19\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\n`.github/workflows/bump-marketplace.yml` commits and pushes a version bump directly to `main` as `github-actions[bot]` using `secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN`. Every run since the `main` branch ruleset (id 20773573, created 2026-08-13T11:13:51+10:00) went active has failed identically:\\n\\n```\\ngh run list -R Jamie-BitFlight/claude_skills --workflow \\\"Bump Marketplace Version\\\" --limit 5 --json conclusion,createdAt\\n\u2192 5/5 most recent runs: conclusion \\\"failure\\\" (latest 2026-08-18T11:21:58Z)\\n\\nFailure log:\\nremote: error: GH013: Repository rule violations found for refs/heads/main.\\nremote: - 3 of 3 required status checks are expected.\\n ! [remote rejected] main -> main (push declined due to repository rule violations)\\n```\\n\\nThe ruleset's `bypass_actors` list is not empty (it now contains 4 Integration-type actor IDs \u2014 this appears to be a partial remediation attempt already made by another session), but the push is still being rejected with the identical error as of the most recent run. Whatever was added either isn't the actor identity that performs this push, or `bypass_actors` doesn't cover this rule type the way it was configured. Root cause of why the current bypass configuration doesn't work is not yet established.\\n\\nImpact: the marketplace version bump automation has been silently non-functional for 5+ days, and \u2014 per the companion item on required-checks coverage (#2989) \u2014 this failure was invisible in any check that gates a PR merge, because it isn't one of the jobs required by the ruleset.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer relying on this plugin**, I want to **ci: bump marketplace version workflow's push is rejected by the branch ruleset \u2014 broken since 2026-08-13** so that **the tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Workflow-quality review, 2026-08-18/19, re-verified live 2026-08-19\\n- **Priority**: P0\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-19\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"9cebf4a814d186e8b7ad32a03a14e29661d69a548ae85846057ba28aa37d89bd\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPgvwGg\"}"}